# (1) Build: Treasure shards early, then Bruiser instead of Jungle, as the top ladder
#     teams do. The aim is to win more fights at even strength.
# (2) Fuel: camp choice now runs closest() lazily. gem_target is only searched when the
#     rich group is not taken. The opener dash needs DASH_FUEL. Very low fuel turns skip
#     camp scoring and just walk to the nearest camp. This targets the ~17 turns per game
